1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:06,617
Picked up a serum in Bedfordview, and the label reads like code?

2
00:00:06,617 --> 00:00:08,673
Let's play detective.

3
00:00:08,673 --> 00:00:10,925
Three clues, one label.

4
00:00:11,625 --> 00:00:13,936
First, the disclosure.

5
00:00:13,936 --> 00:00:21,290
dermatology dot joburg earns a commission if you buy through our link.

6
00:00:21,290 --> 00:00:29,799
We're not dermatologists or doctors, and this is general product information, not

7
00:00:29,799 --> 00:00:31,375
medical advice.

8
00:00:32,180 --> 00:00:38,222
Today's case: AGE Bright Clearing Serum, thirty milliliters.

9
00:00:38,222 --> 00:00:46,682
Its description: an active two-in-one serum that clears and helps prevent breakouts,

10
00:00:46,682 --> 00:00:50,206
while reducing visible skin ageing.

11
00:00:51,007 --> 00:00:53,166
Clue one: the number.

12
00:00:53,166 --> 00:00:59,747
The product page lists salicylic acid at two point zero percent.

13
00:01:00,447 --> 00:01:03,403
Clue two: the ingredient list.

14
00:01:03,403 --> 00:01:08,231
Niacinamide appears second, straight after water.

15
00:01:08,231 --> 00:01:16,508
Further down sits the white shiitake mushroom extract the description pairs it with,

16
00:01:16,508 --> 00:01:20,843
for a brighter, more even-looking skin tone.

17
00:01:21,642 --> 00:01:24,379
Clue three: the directions.

18
00:01:24,379 --> 00:01:28,332
Apply a thin layer and allow it to dry.

19
00:01:28,332 --> 00:01:34,414
Use it under your moisturizer, up to twice a day, as needed.

20
00:01:35,114 --> 00:01:37,052
And the fine print.

21
00:01:37,052 --> 00:01:43,275
People with sensitive skin may want to build up to daily use.

22
00:01:43,275 --> 00:01:51,129
Anyone sensitive to salicylic acid may want to patch test first, or avoid it.

23
00:01:51,829 --> 00:01:53,017
Case closed.

24
00:01:53,017 --> 00:02:00,841
A number, a list position, and a line of directions tell you most of the story.

25
00:02:00,841 --> 00:02:03,812
Read all three before you buy.

26
00:02:04,512 --> 00:02:12,428
The serum is linked at dermatology dot joburg, and we earn a commission on purchases

27
00:02:12,428 --> 00:02:14,124
through that link.

28
00:02:14,124 --> 00:02:16,763
Subscribe for the next case.
